You strike the target with your tailsaw for [133%, 155%, 172%, 187%, 200% (TL1-5)] damage. If this hits, you attempt to clamp them with your pincers for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns. This pins, reduces their attack, spell and mind speed by [5%, 16%, 23%, 28%, 31% (TL1-5)], and lets you make a free, unavoidable strike with your tailsaw against them each turn for [66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100% (TL1-5)] damage. This ends if you move more than 1 tile from the target.
